---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import TermPanel from './system/TermPanel.astro';
import CheckRow from './system/CheckRow.astro';

// The four marks map one to one onto the four fields a verdict records.
// Three struck, one not. The fourth is the one nobody can strike for
// themselves, which the copy under the panel already says, so showing all
// four struck contradicted the sentence beside it.
const marks = [
  { id: 'AGT', gloss: 'which agent wrote it', struck: true },
  { id: 'AUT', gloss: 'what authority it held', struck: true },
  { id: 'VER', gloss: 'what verified it', struck: true },
  { id: 'APR', gloss: 'who approved', struck: false },
] as const;

const frameworks = [
  'EU AI Act Art. 12 & 14',
  'NIST AI agent standards',
  'CSA agentic trust',
];

const description = `Hallmark. ${marks.map((m) => `${m.gloss}: ${m.struck ? 'struck' : 'not struck'}`).join(', ')}.`;
---

<Section id="the-record">
  <h2 class="h2 reveal">Prove a human oversaw the machine.</h2>

  <p class="reveal body mt-8" style="--reveal-delay:120ms;max-width:64ch">
    December 2027: the EU AI Act requires logged, documented human oversight of high-risk
    AI systems. Singapore&rsquo;s IMDA framework already calls for an audit trail of which
    agent acted under whose authority.
  </p>

  <p class="reveal body mt-6" style="--reveal-delay:60ms;max-width:64ch">
    Every Assay verdict is a signed attestation.
  </p>

  <div class="reveal mt-10" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
    <TermPanel path="Hallmark · struck on every verdict" label={description}>
      {
        marks.map((m) =>
          m.struck ? (
            <CheckRow id={m.id} name={m.gloss} state="pass" status={"\u2713"} />
          ) : (
            <CheckRow id={m.id} name={m.gloss} state="pending" status="" />
          ),
        )
      }
    </TermPanel>
  </div>

  <p class="reveal body mt-10" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
    The verdict becomes the record. The fourth punch is the one nobody can strike for
    themselves: independence is the part you cannot self-certify.
  </p>

  <ul class="reveal mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-line pt-5" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
    {frameworks.map((name) => <li class="chip">{name}</li>)}
  </ul>
</Section>
